ge case handling, or logical errors."\n        )\n        revised_solution = await self.revise(instruction=revision_instruction, context=initial_solution)\n\n        # Step 4: Summarize the final solution for clarity\n        summary_instruction = (\n            f"Given the revised solution: {revised_solution}\\n"\n            "Summarize the solution in a concise manner, highlighting the key steps and reasoning. "\n            "Ensure the summary is clear and easy to understand."\n        )\n        final_summary = await self.summarize(instruction=summary_instruction, context=revised_solution)\n\n        # Step 5: Ensemble to select the best solution\n        ensemble_instruction = (\n            f"Given the initial solution: {initial_solution}\\n"\n            f"Revised solution: {revised_solution}\\n"\n            "Select the best solution based on correctness, clarity, and adherence to the docstring specification. "\n            "Provide a final decision on which solution to use."\n        )\n        final_decision = await self.ensemble(instruction=ensemble_instruction, contexts=[initial_solution, revised_solution])\n\n        # Step 6: Return the final solution\n        return final_decision\n```', '<think>\n</think>\n\n</think>\n\n```python\n# --- DO NOT IMPORT HERE ---\nclass Workflow:\n    def __init__(self, config, problem) -> None:\n        # --- DO NOT MODIFY THIS SECTION ---\n        self.config = config\n        self.problem_text = problem\n        self.llm = create(config)\n        \n        self.generate = operator.Generate(self.llm, self.problem_text)\n        self.revise = operator.Revise(self.llm, self.problem_text)\n        self.summarize = operator.Summarize(self.llm, self.problem_text)\n        self.ensemble = operator.Ensemble(self.llm, self.problem_text)\n\n    async def run_workflow(self):\n        """\n        Implement the core problem-solving logic here.\n        Remember: \n        - Use detailed, comprehensive instructions\n        - Dyna